<title>SWEDEN: Astra proposes stock dividend, split.</title>
<headline>Astra proposes stock dividend, split.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish drug company Astra AB said on Wednesday its board of directors had proposed a one for three stock dividend and a two for one stock split.</p>
</text>
